**/.DS_Store
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/.backup-*
.claude/memory/
# Reference copies init.sh drops during an upgrade so you can diff your own
# CLAUDE.md / settings.json against the current template. Regenerated every
# upgrade; in this repo they are just stale duplicates of templates/.
.claude/.cc-discipline-claude-md-template
.claude/.cc-discipline-settings-template.json
# Transient: the template offered when a locally-modified skill is preserved.
# Resolve it (diff, then keep yours or mv it into place) rather than committing it.
.claude/skills/*/SKILL.md.new
